Generic image maps for Agent Substrate v1.0.1 (20778a6dbb01f13024642851bb592bf67c9fec05).

Install exact prebuilt references without ko or registry resolution. Keep ordinary
registry installs unchanged. Snapshotter pod archives use nix:0; the independent
atelet image source continues to use nix:/ root trees for actors. Retains the
original Apache-2.0 notices of the extracted installer implementation.

